{"id":"2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall","date":"2026-11-27","topic":"markets","region":"americas","headline":"New York Named Wall Street After an Old Wall","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wall_Street"},"accent":"au","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"People built a long wooden wall in New York.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.44,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.51,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.74,1.02,1.38,1.86,2.3,2.56,2.78]},{"text":"The wooden wall protected the northern side of the town.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":3.45,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.2,0.64,1.22,1.56,1.88,2.48,2.64,2.76]},{"text":"Workers removed the old wall many years later.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":5.24,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.72,1.14,1.46,1.88,2.32,2.86]},{"text":"People still called the long road Wall Street.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","C","C"],"dur":3.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.92,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.58,0.94,1.3,1.54,1.92,2.38]},{"text":"Today, Wall Street is a famous financial center.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t1-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":4.61,"times":[0.0,0.62,0.82,1.14,1.44,1.54,2.02,2.42]}],"bands":{"core1000":87,"core1800":8,"ngsl":5,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":0},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"many years later","title":"Time Expression as Modifier","note":"This phrase tells us when the action happened. It functions as an adverbial modifier positioned at the end of the sentence."},{"i":3,"focus":"called the long road Wall Street","title":"Verb with Object and Complement","note":"The verb 'call' takes a direct object ('the long road') followed by an object complement ('Wall Street'). The complement gives the noun its new name."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the seventeenth century, settlers built a tall wooden wall in New York.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.96,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.32,0.94,1.86,2.22,2.66,2.9,3.24,3.7,4.14,4.46,4.68]},{"text":"The barrier protected the town, but the city grew bigger over time.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","S","V","C","M","M"],"dur":4.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.79,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.8,1.14,1.9,2.06,2.16,2.38,2.7,3.12,3.52]},{"text":"Workers removed the wall in 1699, so the physical barrier vanished.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","S","S","V"],"dur":5.32,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":7.47,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.68,1.04,1.28,1.54,3.2,3.44,3.66,3.96,4.44]},{"text":"The road kept its old name because people remembered the history.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.81,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.91,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.3,0.66,0.92,1.18,1.56,2.06,2.38,2.86,3.24]},{"text":"Today, Wall Street is the main center for big money and businesses.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.99,"times":[0.0,0.74,0.94,1.24,1.56,1.7,1.92,2.46,2.74,3.02,3.46,3.68]},{"text":"People will always remember the famous street and its humble wooden past.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.59,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.38,0.82,1.28,1.52,1.84,2.28,2.78,2.88,3.18,3.78]}],"bands":{"core1000":82,"core1800":6,"ngsl":6,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":6},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"but the city grew bigger","title":"Coordinating Conjunction","note":"The word 'but' links two complete clauses to show contrast. Here, the town was protected, but urban growth changed the situation."},{"i":3,"focus":"because people remembered the history","title":"Reason Clause with Because","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces a subordinate clause explaining why the road kept its name. The whole clause serves as an adverbial modifier."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"During the seventeenth century, New York was a small Dutch settlement called New Amsterdam.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.9,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.52,1.04,1.94,2.18,2.46,2.74,2.86,3.2,3.62,4.1,4.68,5.06]},{"text":"Leaders built a wooden wall that marked the northern boundary of the early town.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":4.93,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.66,0.9,1.16,1.7,2.06,2.38,2.68,3.04,3.46,4.0,4.1,4.36]},{"text":"Workers tore down the wooden wall in 1699 after the city expanded beyond it.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.71,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.96,"times":[0.38,0.38,0.64,1.08,1.26,1.44,1.82,2.08,3.14,3.92,4.06,4.3,4.9,5.28]},{"text":"The local street kept its name, which has now become famous around the world.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.73,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.3,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.66,1.1,1.34,2.08,2.18,2.32,2.6,2.88,3.5,3.9,4.14]},{"text":"Today, Wall Street hosts the New York Stock Exchange, a venue where shares are traded.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.36,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.8,1.14,1.52,1.94,2.12,2.48,2.78,3.84,3.94,4.18,4.62,4.84,5.14]},{"text":"Investors have bought and sold financial assets on this narrow street for centuries.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.19,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.64,0.98,1.2,1.56,2.06,2.5,2.8,2.92,3.24,3.6,4.08]}],"bands":{"core1000":82,"core1800":12,"ngsl":4,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":1},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"after the city expanded beyond it","title":"Adverbial Time Clause","note":"The word 'after' starts a dependent clause that tells us when the wall was torn down. It adds time information to the main clause."},{"i":5,"focus":"have bought and sold","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect form 'have bought and sold' describes an activity that began in the past and continues up to the present day."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the seventeenth century, New York was originally established as a Dutch trading post called New Amsterdam.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":7.73,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.32,0.9,1.8,2.12,2.46,2.78,3.16,3.82,4.2,4.32,4.58,5.02,5.48,6.16,6.52]},{"text":"A barrier made of wooden planks was constructed along the northern border of the settlement.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.92,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":5.29,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.34,0.76,0.96,1.18,1.86,2.02,2.44,2.94,3.1,3.36,3.86,4.14,4.26]},{"text":"The physical wall was eventually dismantled in 1699 because the city had outgrown its original boundaries.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.77,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.42,0.78,1.04,1.6,2.04,2.68,3.66,4.6,4.76,5.02,5.28,5.9,6.16,6.62]},{"text":"Historians noted that the adjacent roadway retained its name long after the structure disappeared.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.94,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.67,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.92,1.2,1.34,1.72,2.38,2.78,3.3,3.6,4.06,4.52,4.7,4.96]},{"text":"Over time, financial institutions began congregating along the historic corridor to conduct commercial transactions.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.0,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.82,1.32,2.18,2.68,3.56,3.86,4.02,4.28,4.78,5.48,5.78,6.2]},{"text":"Today, Wall Street represents the central hub of American finance and global stock trading activities.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.89,"times":[0.0,0.68,0.9,1.26,1.78,2.2,2.62,3.02,3.26,3.56,4.12,4.8,5.08,5.52,5.98]},{"text":"It is home to the world's largest stock market, where major public corporations are publicly evaluated.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":6.85,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.14,0.36,0.62,0.72,1.12,1.68,2.02,2.94,3.0,3.34,3.7,4.26,4.8,5.14]}],"bands":{"core1000":69,"core1800":12,"ngsl":9,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"had outgrown","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"The past perfect 'had outgrown' expresses an event that occurred before another past event (being dismantled in 1699)."},{"i":3,"focus":"that the adjacent roadway retained its name long after the structure disappeared","title":"Noun Clause as Object","note":"The conjunction 'that' introduces a whole clause that functions as the direct object of the verb 'noted'."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Long before it came to symbolize global finance, Wall Street was literally named after a protective wooden fortification in New Amsterdam.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.58,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.52,0.72,0.88,1.04,1.6,1.92,3.22,3.32,3.68,4.08,4.4,4.88,5.42,5.58,5.96,6.38,7.18,7.56,7.7]},{"text":"Constructed in 1653 along the northern boundary of the Dutch settlement, the wall was meant to guard the town against unwanted incursions.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":9.93,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.36,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.74,2.54,3.24,3.5,3.72,4.24,4.48,4.6,4.74,5.7,5.9,6.12,6.4,6.64,6.82,7.02,7.26,7.52,8.08,8.74]},{"text":"By 1699, urban expansion had rendered the structure obsolete, prompting city officials to dismantle the wooden planks entirely.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","V","O","O","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.44,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.38,"times":[0.0,0.12,2.26,2.62,3.14,3.58,3.88,4.1,4.38,5.68,5.9,6.24,6.72,7.04,7.36,7.76,7.9,8.4]},{"text":"Although the physical barrier vanished, the underlying thoroughfare permanently retained the simple name that reflected its historic origins.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.24,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.5,0.76,1.14,2.3,2.38,2.82,3.62,4.2,4.7,5.06,5.22,5.66,6.2,6.54,6.94,7.28]},{"text":"In subsequent decades, traders and merchants began gathering along the street to buy and sell emerging financial securities.","voice":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.82,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-27-markets-new-york-named-wall/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":7.53,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,1.5,1.76,2.16,2.36,2.94,3.4,3